<title>USA: NY/NJ Port $150 mln AMT bonds won by Lehman.</title>
<headline>NY/NJ Port $150 mln AMT bonds won by Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it won $150 million Port Authority of New York and New Jersey bonds, subject to the alternative minimum tax, at a true interest cost of 5.507 percent.</p>
</text>
